DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260912
SUMMARY:Rest — 0 km
DESCRIPTION:Full non-running recovery day after the bike transfer and Friday relay session. Optional walking and 10–15 min gentle mobility only.\nPace: None.\nHR: None.\nRecovery: Full recovery day.\nTerrain: Flat/none.\nPurpose: Absorb accumulated cycling and running load\; no missed mileage is made up.\nIf fatigued: Keep this as rest if legs are heavy\, sleep is poor\, or any soreness alters mechanics.
