DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260918
SUMMARY:Rest — 0 km
DESCRIPTION:Full rest from running after the Night Run. Optional walking and gentle mobility only.\nPace: None.\nHR: None.\nRecovery: Full recovery day.\nTerrain: Flat/none.\nPurpose: Absorb the B-race and protect the final HM taper.\nIf fatigued: Keep the rest day\; do not add the former 400 m session.
CATEGORIES:RUNNING,REST
STATUS:CONFIRMED
