DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
SUMMARY:Recovery — 7 km
DESCRIPTION:7 km very easy\; no pace objective.\nPace: Usually 4:45–5:30/km or slower\; breathing and legs must remain easy.\nHR: Use HR as a cap/secondary check\, not a target. No threshold inference from HR alone.\nRecovery: 60–90 s walk/jog between optional strides.\nTerrain: Flat/gentle\; avoid technical descents.\nPurpose: Restore movement and circulation while absorbing the previous hard day.\nIf fatigued: Rest instead if soreness changes mechanics or pain is focal/worsening.
CATEGORIES:RUNNING,RECOVERY
STATUS:CONFIRMED
