UID:bad-ischl-2026-09-22@local-running-coach
DTSTAMP:20260912T180132Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260922
SUMMARY:Hm-Specific Tune-Up — 10 km
DESCRIPTION:3 km easy\; drills + strides\; 2 × 2 km at goal HM pace with 2:00 easy jog\; 2–3 km cool-down.\nPace: 3:32–3:34/km. Exact rhythm\, never faster than 3:30/km.\nHR: Let HR rise naturally\; it is a rehearsal\, not a fitness test.\nRecovery: 2:00 easy jog between the 2 km blocks.\nTerrain: Flat\, accurately measured route with minimal interruptions.\nPurpose: Rehearse HM rhythm while preserving freshness after the Night Run.\nIf fatigued: Run only 1 × 2 km at HM pace\, or 6–8 km easy\, if fatigue persists.
CATEGORIES:RUNNING,HM-SPECIFIC TUNE-UP
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
