UID:bad-ischl-2026-09-24@local-running-coach
DTSTAMP:20260912T180132Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260924
SUMMARY:Easy — 7 km
DESCRIPTION:7 km easy on gently rolling terrain\; no hill sprints.\nPace: Conversational effort\; typically 4:25–5:05/km\, but slow further for heat\, hills\, or fatigue.\nHR: Use HR as a cap/secondary check\, not a target. No threshold inference from HR alone.\nRecovery: 60–90 s walk/jog between optional strides.\nTerrain: Only 100–150 m ascent\; avoid technical trails and eccentric downhill load.\nPurpose: Aerobic volume and musculoskeletal durability without compromising key sessions.\nIf fatigued: Reduce to 5 km or take rest if fatigue is abnormal.
CATEGORIES:RUNNING,EASY
STATUS:CONFIRMED
